    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 为什么不能在表中间插入列",
      "summary": "Tianzhou 指出根源：PostgreSQL 用不可变的 attnum 同时表示列的身份、物理位置和显示顺序，pg_attribute 的编号顺序分配、永不复用，删列留下空洞，重排会牵动引用它的索引与约束。列顺序不只是美观，按对齐宽度排列最多省两成表体积，眼下只能用 CREATE TABLE AS SELECT 重建表。MySQL 的 InnoDB 自 8.0.29 起分开逻辑与物理顺序，社区同类提案至今未落地。",
      "url": "https://www.bytebase.com/blog/why-its-hard-to-add-a-column-in-the-middle-of-postgres-table/",
      "author": "Tianzhou",
      "source": "Bytebase 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-06-26",
      "image": "https://www.bytebase.com/images/og/blog/why-its-hard-to-add-a-column-in-the-middle-of-postgres-table.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "表结构",
        "attnum",
        "存储"
      ],
      "position": 4
